#### 1. `aiLevel` setting

```ts
// src/game/ai/types.ts
export type AiLevel = 'beginner' | 'intermediate' | 'advanced' | 'expert';

export interface AiProfile {
  thinkDelayMs: [number, number];
  aimSpreadRad: number;
  powerJitter: number;
  powerMistakeChance: number;       // chance of large wrong-power error
  ruleAwareness: number;
  foulAvoidance: number;
  useSpin: boolean;
  safetyBias: number;
  topK: number;                     // pick among top K scored candidates
  badShotChance: number;            // deliberately pick low-ranked shot
  preferScoringOnly: boolean;       // filter to scoring candidates when any exist
}
```

| Level | EN label | KO label | Character |
|-------|----------|----------|-----------|
| `beginner` | Beginner | 초보 | Wide spread, slow think, often picks geometric shortest path even if foul/miss |
| `intermediate` | Intermediate | 중급 | Moderate spread; prefers rule-valid 3C paths; basic 4B foul avoidance |
| `advanced` | Advanced | 고급 | Tight spread; scores candidates by expected points; spin for cushion routes |
| `expert` | Expert | 전문가 | Minimal spread; break + safety awareness; best valid shot among top candidates |

