### Phase 4 — Win flow & consistency

**Status:** Not started  
**Scope:** Win overlay modal on dimmed table; remove inline `winBanner`. Optional: align Intro + Settings with `theme` tokens. **Does not** change scoring, restart logic, or `restart()` implementation.  
**Next:** Phase 5 (optional polish).

**Goal:** When `winner` is set, show a modal overlay on top of the playboard (table dimmed) with trophy, winner name, **Play Again**, and **Back to menu** — HUD stays visible but non-interactive; no gold banner that steals vertical space from the board.

#### Current win UI (baseline — remove in Phase 4)

| Piece | `BilliardsView` | `FourBallView` | Problem |
|-------|-----------------|----------------|---------|
| Placement | `winBanner` below `GameHudPanel` inside `hudChrome` | same | Pushes layout; disconnects from table |
| Winner text | emoji + `player1` / `player2` / `ai` + 🏆 | same | OK for modal; remove from inline banner |
| Play Again | `TouchableOpacity` → `restart()` | same | Keep; use `skipRestartConfirm` on win overlay |
| Back to menu | — | — | Add via `onBack` prop |

Styles to delete after extraction: `winBanner`, `winText`, `playAgainBtn`, `playAgainText` (per view).

#### Architecture

```
src/components/
  ui/
    WinOverlay.tsx          — Modal + dim scrim + card (trophy, winner, actions)
  gameHud/
    GameWinOverlay.tsx      — thin wrapper: builds winner label from game-specific props
```

**Why a thin game wrapper:** Billiards uses `winner: 1 | 2`; FourBall uses `'yellow' | 'white'`. Wrapper maps to display string + marble color; `WinOverlay` stays presentational.

#### Visual spec

```
Scrim:           rgba(0,0,0,0.55) over full playboard (arenaShell), not over HUD
Card:            colors.hudBg, borderRadius radii.md, padding spacing.lg
Trophy:          🏆 or colors.win accent
Winner text:     typography.score (20px), colors.textOnDark
Subtitle:        optional final score line (typography.stat, textMuted)
Primary CTA:     Play Again — colors.accent fill
Secondary CTA:   Back to menu — ghost / outline (reuse IconButton pattern)
```

Modal uses RN `Modal` with `transparent` + centered card, or absolute `View` overlay inside `arenaShell` so HUD nav remains reachable for Back (choose one — recommend overlay inside `arenaShell` only so table dims, HUD stays crisp).

#### Component contracts

**`WinOverlay`**

```ts
interface WinOverlayProps {
  visible: boolean;
  lang: Lang | undefined;
  winnerLabel: string;       // e.g. "Player 1" or "AI"
  winnerMarbleColor?: string;
  onPlayAgain: () => void;
  onBackToMenu: () => void;
  skipRestartConfirm?: boolean;  // true for Play Again from win state
}
```

**`BilliardsWinOverlay` / `FourBallWinOverlay`** (or single helper `getWinnerDisplay(...)`)

```ts
// Billiards: winner 1 | 2, vsAI
// FourBall: winner 'yellow' | 'white', vsAI
```

#### Layout integration (per view)

