```

**After Phase 4:**

```
hudChrome
  GameHudPanel (scoreboard shows final state; ShotControls hidden when winner)
arenaShell
  table ...
  WinOverlay (absolute fill, visible when winner)
```

- Remove `{winner && <View style={winBanner}>…}` from both views
- `WinOverlay` rendered inside `arenaShell` / `arenaWrap` as last child (high z-index)
- `onPlayAgain` → existing `restart()`; pass `skipRestartConfirm={true}` or wire through `confirmRestart`
- `onBackToMenu` → existing `onBack` prop

